<SCENARIO VER="105">
{PLAYSND "システム音\The_Lampe.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<TXSPN>"Thank you for all your hard work, <VAR NAME="プレイヤー名" unk3="50">-sama. You have reached the fifth ending."<PG>
"The Great Motoki Earthquake. One mystery led to another, and in the end, only mysteries remained."<PG>
"To look at it positively, unlike the other scenarios, this one focused not on the third generation, in which the Green-Eye Curse-Killing occurs, but on the secrets of the first and second generations."<PG>
"What do you think, <VAR NAME="プレイヤー名" unk3="50">-sama?" 
{PAUSE ""}
{}
<EVENT VALUE="NOREPAGE">
<EVENT VALUE="MESEND">
